hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1742","**\nNarrated to us 'Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-'Ala and Sa'id ibn 'Abd al-Rahman: They both said: Sufyan narrated to us, from Safwan ibn Sulaym, from 'Ata' ibn Yasar, from Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (RA) who said that 'Abd al-Jabbar narrated the following version, while Sa'id said: Indeed, the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \The bath of Friday is obligatory upon every post-pubescent person.\"""""""
